  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing capacities in agricultural innovation systems: scaling up the Tropical Agriculture Platform Framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project will operate at global level to facilitate the global TAP partnership, document lessons learned, update and complement TAP tools, and organize global knowledge sharing on AIS. At regional/sub-regional level in Africa, Asia and Latin America, the project will further develop regional organizations capacity to analyze and strengthen AIS and supporting policies within their constituencies. At national level, working with national partners in nine countries to scale out the CDAIS.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
